public class ArrayStack<T> implements IGenStack<T>{private final T[]data;private int size;public ArrayStack(T[]data){this.data=data;size=(int)java.util.Arrays.stream(data).filter(java.util.Objects::nonNull).count();}public void push(T value)throws StackFullException{if(size==data.length)throw new StackFullException(size);data[size++]=value;}public T pop()throws StackEmptyException{if(size==0)throw new StackEmptyException("empty");return data[--size];}}
